    "summary": "The Repo Configuration panel shows, for the chosen repo, a tier select per taxonomy role (global / core / mid / cheap, from models.byRepo[repo].tasks) and a coreFloor select, laid out as table rows (c6f35e07f, after a rendered screenshot showed the selects running together); no runner, model or effort field. The write handler accepts only ['tasks', roleId] and ['coreFloor'] (anything else dropped with a warning before consent), shows the daemon's reason and detail, and offers a restart (restartDaemonAndReport) on restartRequired. The existing panel tests were moved to the new segments. Mutation-checked: the segment guard.",
